2 CONT Anna Ivarsdatter Slede-Oma b. Oma Strandebarm Hordaland. NorwayAt Indre Oma, an old smoking room burned down in 1848, and old people have told us that the living room had earthen benches around the walls, oars in the middle of the
2 CONC  floor and stone floors. On one piece it said that the house was built in 1347 by Ivar Ivarsen Slæde.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Sunnhordlandsslekter 1 and 2, Den Kløyvde Lilja by Kolbjørn E. Ekkje.
