2 CONT * Married: (3)  '''The famous Hestbø knight and sheriff in Skien, Ivar Ogmunsson Rova,''' son of Agmund Sigurdsson of hestbø at Finnøy in Ryfylke. Mentioned in 1295 as a knight, later became Baron and Marker of Håkon V.
