2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes married Havtore Jonsson Roos til Sudreim, son of Jon Raud Ivarsson Roos til Sudreim and Unknown, in 1302. (Havtore Jonsson Roos til Sudreim was born circa 1275 and died in 1320 in Sørum (Sudreim, Skedjuhof)), Sørum, Akershus
2 CONC , Norway .)
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes married Havtore Jonsson Roos Til Sudreim, son of Jon Raud Ivarsson Roos Til Sudreim and Ukjent, in 1302. (Havtore Jonsson Roos Til Sudreim was born around 1275 and died in 1320 in Sørum (Sudreim, Skedjuhof)), Sørum, Akershus
2 CONC  , Norway.)
