2 CONT Magnus Lagabøte (old Norse Magnús lagabœtir, English Magnus the law-mender) or Magnus Håkonsson (old Norse Magnús Hákonarson) (1238 - 9 May 1280), was king of Norway from 1263 until 1280.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents [hide]
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 Early life 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 Reign 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1 Foreign policy 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.2 Internal policies 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 Death and aftermath 
2 CONT
