2 CONT * Norwegian Biographical Lexicon" (Volume I, published in 1924), CM Munthe in "Norwegian Slander" (NST in 1928), Mogens Bugge in "Our Ancestors" and by Bent and Vidar Billing Hansen in "The Rosens Sword's Ancestors"
