1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~corpusnobiliorum/hollung.html
2 CONT
2 CONT This family originally stemmed from Scania and begins with a Jens or Niels Benedictsen of Bramme, known 1315, married Johanne Aagesdatter (Thott). They had issue as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. ? Benedict Jensen. 1.1. Niels Benedictsen of Lyngbygaard, known 1398, married Sophie Bentsdatter Lang. 1.1.1. Elsef, died before 1420. 1.1.2. Gythe, died before 1420. 1.1.3. Karen, married Otto Rekhals. 2. Anders "Gaggæ", known
2 CONC  1355, married N. N. Lang. 2.1. Henrik Andersen, known 1387, married Bodil Mortensdatter (Skalder). 2.1.1. Peder Henriksen, known 1459-1462, married Karen Sivertsdatter (Blaa). 2.1.1.1. Bodil, married Oluf Grubbe (sparre) of Sandb
2 CONC ygaard. 2.1.2. Anne. 2.1.3. Tage Henriksen of Bramme, Jordbjerg and Dybæk, died after 1504, married Karen Christensdatter (Tornekrands; died after 24 June 1514). 2.1.3.1. Christen Tagesen, died after 1513. 2.1.3.2. Ove Tagesen, ma
2 CONC rried Anne Juel. 2.1.3.3. Helle, died 30 March 1550, married Peder Marsvin (died 21 October 1528), both buried at Lund cathedral. 2.1.3.4. Bodil, died before 1528, married Jakob Ged of Røsøholm. 2.1.3.5. Karen, married Otte Anders
2 CONC en (Thott) of Næs. 2.1.3.6. Margrethe, married Erik Christoffersen (Dyre) of Vindinge (died about 1553/4), both buried at Vindinge church. 2.1.3.7. Maren, married Iver Kaas of Nørgaard. 2.2. Holger Most, known 1419.
