2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT var Torgilsson Slede-Oma  
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: Before.1270 in Oma.Hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: Before.1320 in Oma.Hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
