2 CONT    Alfonso (future Alfonso IV of Aragon and II of Valencia) Alfonso IV (II of Valencia) Children include
2 CONT    Peter (future Peter IV of Aragon and II of Valencia) Peter IV (II of Valencia) Children include
2 CONT    Constance, Queen of Sicily
2 CONT    John (future John I of Aragon and Valencia)
