1 NOTE King of Sweden between 1060 and 1066
1 NOTE Steinkel of Vastergotland inherited the kingdom of Sweden from his father-in-law, Old Edmund, descendant of Eric the Victorious and Olaf Skotkanung. Reign 1056-1066.
1 NOTE At first Stenkil was Earl in Vastergotland. then King of Sweden from 1056
2 CONT until his death.
1 NOTE 867789452. Konge Stenkild RAGNVALDSSON av Sverige (20589) was a Konge in 1056 in Sverige. (20590) He died in 1066. (20591) He was a Jarl in Vestgotland. (20592) Han var også ivrig kristen He was married to N av Sverige. (20593) D
2 CONC et er usikkert om det var henne som var gift med steinkil
