2 CONT ^ Kings and kingship in Viking Northumbria, by Rory McTurk (University of Leeds) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bibliography
2 CONT Lagerquist, Lars O. (1997). Sveriges Regenter, från forntid till nutid. Norstedts, Stockholm. ISBN 91-1-963882-5 
