2 CONT
2 CONT Se [http://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Rane_Søum_%281%29 denne.] Han eide Søum i Sandsvær og gården Skog i Sande. Han gav en erklæring i 1416 at farne og farfaren var eiere av Fyndarfossen i Reineelva og søndre landet av elva. DN
2 CONC  X 100. Sandsværs historie, III/361. Søum ligger ved hovedveien til Kongsberg nord for Hvittingfoss.
2 CONT
2 CONT See [http://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Rane_Sum_% 281% 29 this.] He owned Soum in Sandsvær farm and forest in the sand. He gave a statement in 1416 that the Farne and his grandfather was the owner of Fyndarfossen in Rein River a
2 CONC nd south of the river country. DN X 100 Sand Weathered history, III/361. Soum is on the main road to the north of Kongsberg Hvittingfoss.
