2 CONT Viking Torgilsen ? died. He married Olov Eriksdtr Galtung, daughter of Erik Sigurdsen Galtung. He was born before 1371.
2 CONT
2 CONT Olov Eriksdtr Galtung married Viking Torgilsen ?, son of Torgils Tronsen Hundevåg. She was born before 1400.
