1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Beata Ivarsdatter Thott==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Ivar Axelsen Thott, till Lillö and Margrethe Poulsdatter Laxmand, til Knabstrup 
2 CONT * Birth: 1439 Visby, Gotland, Sweden
2 CONT * Death: December 04, 1487 (48) in Lund, Skåne (Plauge)
2 CONT * Place of Burial: Lund Domkirke
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Spouse==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: Trud Pedersen Galen til Alverslev ~ ca. 1485 
2 CONT * Married: Arvid Birgersson Trolle, Knabstrup  1466-09-22 in Nyköping with Beata Ivarsdotter, to Lillö in her 2nd marriage (married 1: o with Danish savior Truid Pedersen Galen), died 1487-12-04 (15/12) 11 in the plague and buried
2 CONC  in Lund Cathedral, daughter of the man in Gotland, the knight and the council, Ivar Axelsson (Tott) and his 1st wife Margareta Laxmand. Married 3: o 1488-09-23 at Lagnö in Aspö parish, 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children with Trud Pedersen Galen==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Peder Truidsen, til Alverslev † Alverslev ca 1445
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children with Arvid Birgersson Trolle, Knabstrup==
2 CONT
2 CONT Arvid, (son of Birger, loss 6), to Bergkvara, Bo and Lillö, the latter of which he received through his second marriage, etc. Born in the mid-1430s. Väpnare. National Council already 1463-1501. Struggled during the fighting in the
2 CONC  late 1460s and early 1480s on Karl Knutsson and Sturarna side. Hövidsman at Nyköping Castle 146 (9). Applauded by Karl Knutsson's death 1470 Sten Sture d. Ä. and fought with this in battle at Brunkeberg 1471-10-10. Lagman in Öste
2 CONC rgötland 1470-1497. Lost after breaking with Sten Sture Nyköping Castle County 1487. Hövidsman at Stäkeborg 1493 and at Borgholm 1494. One of the leaders of the insurrection against Sten Sture 1497. Knight by King Hans' krøning s.
2 CONC  And. Teamman in Tiohärads lag saga. Flying at the outbreak of the 1501 revolution from Bergkvara to Denmark and settled on his estate Lillö in Åsum's parish, Kristianstad County. Died there 1505-02-20 and buried in Lund Cathedral
2 CONC . He was a man of law and a great earthquake. In the late 1490s, in the National Archives, the book kept records that only the Småland properties occupy a thousand goods units. 8 Married 1: 0. 1459 with Kristina Johansdotter to Få
2 CONC nö, died before 1465, daughter of the knight and the council Johan Gädda to Fållnäs and his 2nd wife, Katarina Bengtsdotter Königsmarck. Married 2: o 1466-09-22 in Nyköping with Beata Ivarsdotter, to Lillö in her 2nd marriage (mar
2 CONC ried 1: o with Danish savior Truid Pedersen Galen), died 1487-12-04 (15/12) 11 in the plague and buried in Lund Cathedral, daughter of the man in Gotland, the knight and the council, Ivar Axelsson (Tott) and his 1st wife Margareta
2 CONC  Laxmand. Married 3: o 1488-09-23 at Lagnö in Aspö parish, Södermanland County with Brita Turesdotter, dead 1513-10-28 Hinsekind, daughter of the marsh, knight and riksrådet Ture Turesson Bielke and Ingegärd Körningsdotter.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children:==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Anna, died 1473-10-26.
2 CONT * Kristina, dead child.
2 CONT * Elizabeth, dead unmarried.
2 CONT * Margareta, born twin 1475-05-21 on Ed, death 1502 Glimmingehus County. Married 1498-07-29 at Visborg Castle with Danish Parliamentary Council Jens Holgersen (Ulfstand) in his 2nd marriage (married 1: o with Holger Axelsdotter, d
2 CONC ied 1495-11-18 at Visborg Castle, daughter of the Danish Knight and Axel Brahe and Maren Lunge), died 1523-02-06 and buried in Glimmingehus church
2 CONT * Jacob (Joakim), born in 1475. Knight and Amiral. Death 1546. See Tab. 9.
2 CONT * Anna, born 1476-02-04 on Ed, dead 1532-11-01 Fållnäs. Married 1491-07-17 at the latter place with the council and the knight and the team in Östergötland Nils Bosson (grip), born around. 1460, dead 1522-02-14 in Täppe town in Vi
2 CONC ngåkers socken, Södermanland County, killed by his farmers.
2 CONT * Ivar, dumped 1500 in Ditmarschen.
2 CONT * Birger, died in Ditmarschen.
2 CONT * A daughter.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Thott (Axelsønnerne) Geneology - http://www.roskildehistorie.dk/stamtavler/adel/Thott/Axelsoennerne.htm
2 CONT * http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I7696&tree=2
