1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Jöns Knutsson (Tre rosor)=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Gift 1:o före 1472 med Ingegerd, dotter till riddaren och norska riksrådet Erik Samundsson (Skanke) och Estrid Nilsdotter (Välingeätten). 
2 CONT * Gift 2:o med Arffrydh, dotter till riddaren, riksrådet och lagmannen Åke Jänsson (Svarte Skåning) och Metchild Clausdotter (Plata). 
2 CONT * Gift 3:o med Ermegard Fickesdotter, dotter till Ficke Bylow och Hebbla Albrechtsdotter (Bydelsbach) (som gifte om sig med lagmannen Magnus Bengtsson (Natt och Dag)).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Tre_rosor#TAB_6 Tre_rosor, by Adelsvapen]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TABLE 6'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Jöns Knutsson (son of Knut Jonsson Tab. 3 ). National Council. '''Married 1st before 1472 to Ingegerd, daughter of the knight and Norwegian councilor Erik Samundsson (Skanke) and Estrid Nilsdotter (Välingeätten). Married 2nd to Ar
2 CONC ffrydh, daughter of the knight, councilor and lawman Åke Jänsson ( Svarte Skåning ) and Metchild Clausdotter ( Plata ).''' Married 3rd to Ermegard Fickesdotter, daughter of Ficke Bylow and Hebbla Albrechtsdotter ( Bydelsbach ) (wh
2 CONC o remarried the lawman Magnus Bengtsson ( Night and Day )).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. '''Estrid.''' Married to Johan Bese .
2 CONT * 1. '''Ture Jönssson,''' Knight, councillor, lawman and master of the court. Married before 1498 to Anna Johansdotter, daughter of the knight and councilor Johan Christiernsson ( Vasa ) and Brita Tordsdotter ( Bonde ). The wife I
2 CONC ngeborg Engelbrechtsdotter is mentioned as Mr. Tures' concubine and she was the mother of the Riksdag and lawman in Östergötland Jacob Tursson and Elin Tursdotter.
2 CONT * 1. '''Erik Jönsson'''. Married to his stepmother Ermegard Fickesdotter daughter Margareta Månsdotter ( Night and Day )
2 CONT * 2. '''Arfrid Jönsdotter.''' Married to her stepmother's Ermegard Fickesdotter son Johan Månsson ( Night and Day )
2 CONT * 3. '''Agnes Jönsdotter.''' Died unmarried
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=B%c3%b6tils%c3%a4ter&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=4&postid=sdhk_31551&tab=post#tab SDHR-nr: 31551]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Date: 1485  January 18, Place of Issue: Skara''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lindorm Björnsson, magistrate in Västergötland, awards the well-to-do man Jöns Knutsson on behalf of his wife (Ermegard Bulow) the farm Botilsäter (Botilsäters sn) in Näs hd in Värmland and dismisses Ingemar Pellesson, who present
2 CONC ed a mortgage deed. Jöns Knutsson had presented the judgment deed from 1417 (SDHK no. 19003) and 1442 (SDHK no. 24197) before the court as well as a receipt deed (SDHK no. 24183), which documents proved that Mr. Lars Ulfsson had r
2 CONC edeemed his farm.
2 CONT The issuer seals.
2 CONT
2 CONT == [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=%22Ingemar+Pellesson%22&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=3&postid=sdhk_32012&tab=post#tab SDHK-nr: 32012]
2 CONT
2 CONT Utfärdat: 14880217, Arboga Innehåll: Väpnaren Ingemar Pellesson tillkännager att den jord ”Röntegen” (eventuellt i '''Botilsäters sn''') som han av misstag innehaft rätteligen tillhör välboren man '''Jöns Knutsson''' och har legat
2 CONC  till dennes gård '''Botilsäter'''. Därför upplåter han nu jorden till denne.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Date: 1488 February 17 Place of issue: Arboga'''
2 CONT
2 CONT The squire Ingemar Pellesson announces that the land "Röntegen" that he mistakenly possessed rightfully belongs to the well-to-do man Jöns Knutsson and has been part of his farm Botilsäter. Therefore, he now grants the land to him
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT The letter issuer seals together with Lindorm Björnson, magistrate in Västergötland, Olof Björnson, magistrate in Värmland, and Hans Svensson, district governor in Vartofta hd.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
