1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Nils Magnusson''' (Ivar Nilssons ätt)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Magnus Nilsson (Ivar Nilssons ätt) and Ingrid 
2 CONT * Birth: 1310 in Sundby, Österrekarne härad, Södermanland,  Sverige Sweden 
2 CONT * The one mentioned by Dale Nils Magnusson who was married to Kristina Ivarsdotter is Nils Magnusson (Ivar Nilsson's family). He carried a four-piece shield and died August 15, 1368 [ÄSF I: 1 p 65].
2 CONT * Death:	before August 15, 1368 Sverige Sweden 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married (1) before 1335-07-29 '''Ingeborg Knutsdotter (Algotssönernas ätt)'''
2 CONT * Married (2) '''Kristina Ivarsdotter Rova''' (two stone boards). Dead about 1370, buried in Strängnäs Cathedral.  Nils Magnusson, Councilor. Married to Kristina Ivarsdotter Rova, daughter of Ivar Nilsson, fähird in Tønsberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT =SDHC No. 3181=
2 CONT
2 CONT Issued: 13230000 Contents: Inventory of proster property, which domprost Nils (Magnusson) in Strängnäs took over from his representative [Be] ro (Björn).
2 CONT
2 CONT =SDHC No. 3579=
2 CONT
2 CONT Issued: 13290000 Contents: Ulf Håkansson (Läma) and his wife Bengta sell to Mr Nils Magnusson, prostitute in Strängnäs, 8 earland land in Berga in Turinge parish (in Södermanland) and pawns for their farms on 8 ores in Vävle in Jæ
2 CONC der parish.
2 CONT
2 CONT * The one mentioned by Dale Nils Magnusson, who was married to Kristina Ivarsdotter, is Nils Magnusson (Ivar Nilsson). He brought first shield and was dead August 15, 1368 [ESSF: 1 s 65].
2 CONT * This Nils Magnusson can therefore reasonably have not sailed any letters 1374 or 1385
2 CONT * Is identical to the granddaughter mentioned in the father's brother Arvid Magnusson's testament 1344. It is still referred to as 1403 when, together with her husband and brother Ivar Nilsson, she disapproves of all the rights to
2 CONC  Fiets in Jørers sn (Södm), given by Erik Valdemarsson (Folkungaätten, lagm) his wife in the morning gift and this sold to Queen Margrethe. Buried in Vadstena Monastery (Östg).
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://freepages.rootsweb.com/~corpusnobiliorum/genealogy/ivarn.html
2 CONT * https://sv.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivar_Nilsson_(Ivar_Nilssons_%C3%A4tt)
2 CONT * https://sv.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivar_Nilssons_%C3%A4tt
2 CONT
