2 CONT * '''Alla vägar bär till Rom: 75 generationer från von Wachenfeldt och Uggla till'''.- https://books.google.com/books?id=IqoyDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA96&lpg=PA96&dq=Sten+Haraldsson(Gren)+and+Cecilia+Nilsdotter&source=bl&ots=FD7NotFOyH&sig=Sy
2 CONC eLeEGBtE5JuMoKhwgAMtevn7E&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjtjc3Oj5TfAhXpj1QKHZx9B3M4ChDoATAAegQICRAB#v=onepage&q=Sten%20Haraldsson%20(Gren)%20and%20Cecilia%20Nilsdotter&f=false
2 CONT * ÄSF I-1 s 65, s66
2 CONT * Kaj Janzon: Kalle, Nils Magnusson, who was married to Kristina Ivarsdotter, mentioned by Dale above, is Nils Magnusson (Ivar Nilsson's family). He brought a four-piece shield and was dead on August 15, 1368 [ASF I: 1 p. 65]. Thi
2 CONC s Nils Magnusson can therefore reasonably not have signed any letters 1374 or 1385
