2 CONT Sten Haraldsson (Branch) of Ål and his wife Cecilia Nilsdotter give her estate Vållingstad in Husaby (now Östra Husby) parish (Östkinds herad) to Linköping Cathedral. 
2 CONT =History=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Grenholm.'''
2 CONT
