2 CONT
2 CONT ngeborg of Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse	Eric, Duke of Södermanland
2 CONT
2 CONT Knud Porse, Duke of Estonia
2 CONT
2 CONT Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT Magnus VII of Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Euphemia, Duchess of Mecklenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT Haakon, Duke of Halland
2 CONT
2 CONT Canute, Duke of Halland
2 CONT
2 CONT House	Fairhair
