2 CONC , began to relax in his exertions to maintain the usurper. In 1089, Welf's son Welf married Matilda of Tuscany, thus strengthening relationships with the pope. After the younger Welf divorced Matilda in 1095, Welf made amends with
2 CONC  King Henry IV and was reappointed as duke of Bavaria.
