2 CONC i.e. Godwin) sat at table with the king, he suddenly sank down against the footstool, speechless and helpless: he was carried into the king's chamber and it was thought it would pass off, but it was not to be; yet he lingered on l
2 CONC ike this, unable to speak and helpless, until the Thursday, and then gave up his life.
