2 CONT Gytha (?) was born in Denmark. (3) She was the daughter of Thorgils 'Sprakalegg' Styrbjornson and Sigrid of Halland. (1), (2) She married Godwine, Earl of Wessex, son of Wulfnoth, Cyld of Sussex, between 1019 and 1020. (1) She die
2 CONC d after 1069. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT Gytha (?) was also known as Cytha (?).
