2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Sturluson, Snorri (1966). King Harald's Saga. Baltimore, Maryland: Penguin Books, 149. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Hilliam, Paul (2005). William the Conqueror: First Norman King of England. New York City, New York: Rosen Publishing Group, 57. ISBN 1-4042-0166-1. 
2 CONT
