2 CONT ==[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NORWEGIAN%20NOBILITY.htm#HallkelJonssondied1194 Project MedLands, Norway Nobility]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''GUTTORM Asulfsson of Rein,''' son of ASULF Skulesson & his wife Thora Skoptisdotter .  Snorre names "Guthorm of Reine" as the son of "Asolf of Reine" & his wife[239].  Morkinskinna names “Ásólfr, the father of Guthormr at Rein”
2 CONC  as the son of “Skúli, the son of Jarl Tostig Godwinson”[240]. 
