2 CONT Born before 1110 in Gotaland, Sweden, death after 1132. Also like Aanunansson. Sun af Munan Ogmundsson and Inga Vikings daughter Nes. Married to Tora boy orms daughter (c. 1100 in Opplandene-1165 in Folkinsberg, Eidsberg, Ostfold)
2 CONC , daughter af Guttorm Gråbeard (c. 1085-), "a male and cruel man" (Brynjulf Langballe). Tora was the desuden of the mistress of King Harald IV Magnusson Gille, with whom she had been traded. She was "a female and Wicked woman"
