2 CONT Eric IX, King of Sweden1 Last Edited	4 Apr 2020 M, #24781, d. 18 May 1159 Father	Jedward of Sweden Mother	Cecilia of Swedeb
2 CONT      Eric IX, King of Sweden married Christina of Denmark, Queen of Sweden, daughter of Bjorn, Prince of Denmark and Catherine, Princess of Sweden. Eric IX, King of Sweden died on 18 May 1159; Murdered. Family Christina of Denmark
2 CONC , Queen of Sweden Children	 Canute (Knut) I, King of Sweden+ d. 8 Apr 1196 Margareta Eriksdotter of Sweden+2 d. 1209 Citations [S1882] Unknown author, Royal Highness, Ancestry of the Royal Child, by Moncreiffe, p. 113. [S11569] Eu
2 CONC ropaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. II, Tafel 115.________________________
2 CONT
