2 CONT Erik IX, King of Sweden1  M, #113022, d. 1160 Last Edited=15 Jul 2005
2 CONT      Erik IX, King of Sweden was the son of Jedvard (?) and Cecily Svensdottir.2 He married Christina Björnsdottir, daughter of Björn, Prince of Denmark.2 He died in 1160.3
2 CONT      Erik IX, King of Sweden also went by the nick-name of Saint Erik Jedvardsson.3 He succeeded as the King Erik of Sweden in 1156.3 Children of Erik IX, King of Sweden and Christina Björnsdottir Margaret Eriksdottir+1 d. 1209 Kn
2 CONC ut Eriksson, King of Sweden+2 d. 1196 Citations [S16] Jirí Louda and Michael MacLagan, Lines of Succession: Heraldry of the Royal Families of Europe, 2nd edition (London, U.K.: Little, Brown and Company, 1999), table 24. Hereinaft
2 CONC er cited as Lines of Succession. [S16] Louda and MacLagan, Lines of Succession, table 27. [S38] John Morby, Dynasties of the World: a chronological and genealogical handbook (Oxford, Oxfordshire, U.K.: Oxford University Press, 198
2 CONC 9), page 151. Hereinafter cited as Dynasties of the World. ____________________________________________________________--
