1 NOTE Høvedsmann i Vendsyssel Hennes slektslinje er feil, det er ingen bevis
2 CONT for at hun v ar av kongelig slekt.
1 NOTE Danske adelsgodser i middelalderen,Erik Ulsig,Kbh.1968 s 274
2 CONT <br />
2 CONT "Per Nermo" <nermo@online.no> skrev i en meddelelse <news:<3fogtv8od0uegu49soh7ceshvk55mrbf4b@4ax.com>>...
2 CONT > On 10 Dec 2003 16:33:36 -0800, aakren@aol.com (N Aakre) wrote:
2 CONT >
2 CONT > >While being stuck in the English language, I have been trying
2 CONT > >(with difficulty) to follow the discussions (in Norwegian) of  the
2 CONT > >ancestors of Otte Thomassen Orning.
2 CONT > >
2 CONT > >Could someone please enlighten me (in English) on the
2 CONT > >controversy or current thinking about Johanne Andersdtr (c1395-1479)
2 CONT > >of Asdal?  The one I refer to is the wife of Niels Eriksen Banner and
2 CONT > >mother of Karen Nielsdtr Banner.  I have found her listed with
2 CONT > >surnames Til Asdal, Panter, and Paasce.  Are genealogists
2 CONT > >confused by several women with similar names or is there some
2 CONT > >other explanation?  Is there a current consensus on her ancestors,
2 CONT > >or is this an area of disagreement among experts?
2 CONT > >
2 CONT > >             / Erik Banner (1370-1419)
2 CONT > >      / Niels Eriksen Banner (1400-1447)
2 CONT > >     |        Ingegerd Krabbe (1370-
2 CONT > >Karen Nielsdtr Banner (1420-1507)
2 CONT > >     |       / Anders Nielsen (Asdal? Panter? Paasce?)
2 CONT > >       Johanne Andersdtr of Asdal (1385?-1479)
2 CONT > >              Ide Lydersdtr Holck (1350-1425)
2 CONT > >
2 CONT > >Many Thanks.
2 CONT >
2 CONT > I think the main dispute does not concern the one (duchesse) "fru
2 CONT > Johanne til Asdal" (died 1479) that you mention, but rather her
2 CONT > father's mother (and "namesister"), Johanne Andersdatter ("Fru
2 CONT > Johanne"), who was married to Niels Ovesen Sappi (Panter) (knight in
2 CONT > 1355) til Asdal (born in Mors, Thisted, Denmark).
2 CONT > Johanne and Niels' son was Anders Nielsen (Panter) Sappi.
2 CONT > (The Asdal property was located in Skovgaard, Knivholt, Vendsyssel).
2 CONT >
2 CONT > The dispute, as I've understood it, concerns the father
2 CONT > of Johanne; that is whether he was or was not the
2 CONT > nobleman (duke) Anders Albertsen von Eberstein til ╪rnehoved. Lately,
2 CONT > the "most common" conclusion seems to be that this is not the case,
2 CONT > and rather that she was the daughter of one Anders Aagesen
2 CONT > Steenbrikke.
2 CONT >
2 CONT > I'll have to point out that I'm in no way an expert on this, and that
2 CONT > above information is merely "hearsay" and not verified by me from any
2 CONT > primary sources, and thus should be treated accordingly.
2 CONT >
2 CONT > best regards,
2 CONT > Per Nermo
2 CONT > Oslo, Norway
1 NOTE     * RESIDENCE: 1462, Kalt Høvedsmann i Vendsyssel
2 CONT     * OCCUPATION: Grevinne
2 CONT     * BIRTH: ABT 1395, (ca. 1385 ?) Asdal, Hjørring, Horsens, Jylland, DK
2 CONT     * BAPTISM: "Fru Johanne" (II) (Panter) til Asdal
2 CONT     * DEATH: 1479, Dueholm klosterkirke, Mors, DK (1476/7?)
2 CONT     * BURIAL: Dueholm klosterkirke 
1 NOTE Gift 1. med Bonde Due, gift 2. Niels Banner. Hun hadde sønn en Michel Due
2 CONT (f. 1420) med første partner.
