2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Ludvig Nielsen Rosenkrantz recided on Palsgaard, which he probably acquired through marriage, was in 1447 Ridder, counselor, probably in 1453, but certainly in 1455, often sat in courses parliament, 1450-64 Lensman of Riberhus, as
2 CONC  he since lost when he was outlawed, for some reason, just as it is difficult to explain his simultaneous membership of the realm highest Court.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1455 promised by Claus Rantzau that when he would let him get the property that belonged to him after his mother's sister, Mrs. Elena's letter, he would pay its value, in 1468 he participated in the negotiations in Halmstad with t
2 CONC he Swedes, in 1486 he received a pardon for his wrongdoing and North and Baltic pledge against withdrawing his claim to Riberhus . He lived in 1490, and died about 1491 (between July 5, 1490 and July 10, 1492 ) .
