1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Today's historians assume that Snorre's sagas are not historical facts when it comes to the kings living before 11th century, therefore his link to his ancestors has been deleted.=
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT ABT 0935 - ____
2 CONT
2 CONT OCCUPATION: Konge på Ringerike ('i Oplandene' ?)
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH: ABT 0935, (?) Rise på Ringerike 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Sigurd Haraldsønn RISE 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: NN VEBJØRNSDATTER 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : NN NERIDSDATTER 
2 CONT
2 CONT +Sigurd Halvdansson SYR 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilde: nermo.org
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From Snorre Sturlasson: King Olaf Trygvason's Saga:
2 CONT
2 CONT "67. OLAF HARALDSON BAPTIZED.
2 CONT
2 CONT Asta, the daughter of Gudbrand, soon after the fall of Harald Grenske married again a man who was called Sigurd Syr, who was a king in Ringerike. Sigurd was a son of Halfdan, and grandson of Sigurd Hrise, who was a son of Harald H
2 CONC arfager. ..."
2 CONT
2 CONT Det fortelles at han var gift med en datter til Nerid jarl. Dette kan ikke være riktig, da Nerid levde så tidlig som ved 800. Derimot kan hans hustru ha stammet fra ham.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Noted events in his life were:
2 CONT
2 CONT • He was a King of Hadaflyke
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Halfdan Sigurdsson, King of Hadaflyke 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #42756
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=28 May 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      Halfdan Sigurdsson, King of Hadaflyke was the son of Sigurd Hrise, King of Hadaflyke.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Halfdan Sigurdsson, King of Hadaflyke gained the title of King Halfdan of Hadaflyke.
2 CONT
