2 CONC  And Her Family', The American Genealogist, Vol. 72 No.4 (July/October 1997), p. 192 n. 12 4.Jump up ^ David C. Douglas, William the Conqueror (University of California Press,1964), p. 29 5.Jump up ^ Edward Bell, 'The Abbey Church
