2 CONT >1.3.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Judica%C3%ABl-comte-de-Porho%C3%ABt/6000000003649647138?through=6000000009909505293 JUDICAËL] (-1037).  His parentage is confirmed by the charter dated 1026 which recalls that "Gaufridus,
2 CONC  Conani Curvi filius" was killed "apud Concuruz prelium", witnessed by "Judicael et Hurwodius duo fratres ipsius"[128].  Comte de Porhoët. 
