2 CONT >1.4.        [https://www.geni.com/people/Catuallon-de-Bretagne/6000000001588414663?through=6000000009909505293 CATUALLON] (-15 Jan, 1050 or after).  Tresvaux records that Catuallon, brother of Geoffroy I Duke of Brittany, was abb
2 CONC ot of Redon, but does not cite the primary source on which this information is based[129]. 
