2 CONT 3.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Geoffroy-d-Anjou/6000000001744971487?through=6000000009909505293 GEOFFROY] (-after 6 Mar 974).  "Adela" donated property to Saint-Aubin d'Angers by charter dated 6 Mar 974 which names "senio
2 CONC re meo Gauzfredo comite" and is subscribed by "Gauzfredi comitis, Fulconis filii eius, Gauzfredi filii eius"[105]. 
