2 CONT According to ES II:79 Richard II did marry as his first wife Judith ofRennes. Their son and heir was Richard III who married Adelaide countessof Contenance dau. of king Robert II of France. Judith is given as soleissue of that mar
2 CONC riage, and went on to marry Tostig then Welf.[CusterFebruary 1, 2002 Family Tree.FTW]
2 CONT
