2 CONT 1  NAME Robert I "the Devil" of /Normandy/ 2  SOUR S033320 3  DATA 4  TEXT Date of Import: Jan 17, 2001 1  BIRT 2  DATE 999 2  PLAC Normandy, France 2  SOUR S033320 3  DATA 4  TEXT Date of Import: Jan 17, 2001 1  DEAT 2  DATE 22 J
