1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ogive_of_Luxembourg
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Ogive-of-Luxembourg/6000000009432535049
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/132579820/odgiva-countess-de_luxembourg
