2 CONT Rozela d'Ivrea 
2 CONT F, #105913, b. between 950 and 960, d. 25 January 1003 Last Edited=10 May 2003 Consanguinity Index=0.1%
2 CONT      Rozela d'Ivrea was born between 950 and 960. She was the daughter of Berengar II d'Ivrea, King of Italy and Willa di Toscana. She married Arnulf II 'the Younger', Comte de Flandre, son of Baldwin III, Comte de Flandre et Arto
2 CONC is and Matilda Billung, circa 968. She died on 25 January 1003. She was also reported to have died on 7 February 1003.
2 CONT      Rozela d'Ivrea was also known as Susanna d'. Child of Rozela d'Ivrea and Arnulf II 'the Younger', Comte de Flandre -1. Baldwin IV, Comte de Flandre+ b. c 980, d. 30 May 1036
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source: http://www.thepeerage.com/p10592.htm#i105913
