2 CONC s Thyra Haraldsdotter,[citation needed] the daughter of Harold Bluetooth (king of Denmark and Norway).
2 CONT
2 CONT He died at the [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Svolder Battle of Swold].[citation needed]
