2 CONT Torkel Styrbjörnsson, Torgils, Sprakalägg or Sprakling was the son of the disinherited Swedish prince Styrbjörn Starke, the son of king Olof (II) Björnsson of Sweden. His mother was Tyra, the daughter of Harold Bluetooth (king of 
2 CONC Denmark and Norway).
2 CONT
2 CONT He died at the Battle of Swold.
