2 CONT
2 CONT Født ifølge div. profiler: 1170, 1190, 1200. Crusader Ogmund of Sponheim was born circa 1200 at Sponheim, Norway. He is mentioned in 1217/1220 when he traveled over Garda kingdom (Gardariket) to Jerusalem.
2 CONT --------------------
