2 CONT Gouldbrand, the fourth Hersa of Gouldbrandsdall, married Ingrida, a daughter of Sir Steen Arnison of Storkrim, an eminent Knight, and progenitor of the noble family of Sparre in Denmark and Sweden ; the issue of this marriage was 
2 CONC one daughter, who married Hagen, Earl of Laden, and Protector of the kingdom of Norway.
