2 CONT >>>m (1102) [http://www.geni.com/people/Eustace-III-Comte-de-Boulogne/6000000002469127338?through=6000000005599170844  EUSTACHE III] Comte de Boulogne, son of EUSTACHE [II] "Gernobadatus" Comte de Boulogne and Lens & his second wi
