2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Duncan, pp. 47–48; Oram, David I, pp. 35–36; Anderson, SAEC, pp. 109–110. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Oram, David I, pp.36–37. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Duncan, p. 54; Oram, David I, p. 42. 
