2 CONT Regenwald Wolfson, Earl of Gotland in Sweden, or Ragnvald, the son of Ulf”, as was his designation in Norway, whose daughter ”Ostrida” was Bruceson’s first wife. Ulf, Regenwald’s father and Queen Sigrid the Haughty, Olaf’s mother,
2 CONC  were brother and sister, so that Regenwald and Olaf the Swede were first cousins.
