1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Bolesław Mieszkowic''' ('''kujawski''') – '''książę kujawski''' w latach 1186 lub 1194-1195. [http://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boles%C5%82aw_Mieszkowic Wikipedia PL]
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boles%C5%82aw_of_Kuyavia
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ''from http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/POLAND.htm#BoleslawKujaviadied1195 v4.1 Updated 11 May 2018
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince Mieszko & his second wife had five children: 6.         BOLESŁAW (1159-13 Sep 1195).  
2 CONT *The Chronicon Polono-Silesiacum names (in order) the sons of Mieszko III as "Ottonem, Stephanum, Boleslaum, Mesiconem et Vladislaum", specifying that (the last) three were born from "filia regis Russie"[293].  
2 CONT *The Annales Cracovienses Compilati record the birth in 1159 of "Boleslaus filius Meskonis"[294].  
2 CONT *He succeeded in 1194 as Prince of Kujavia.  
2 CONT *The Annales Capituli Cracoviensis record that "Bolezlaus suus [=Mesko] filius" was killed in battle at Moscow in 1195 by Leszek son of Kazimierz[295].  
2 CONT *m ([1187/89]) --- von Pommern, daughter of BOGISLAW I Duke of Pomerania & his first wife Walburgis --- ([1162/72]-[1220/26] or after).  
2 CONT *The Chronicon Polono-Silesiacum refers to "dux Pomeranie" as the father-in-law of one of Mieszko's sons but does not specify which son (although he is named second in the list) or name the son's wife[296].  The chronology suggest
2 CONC s that she must have been born from her father´s first marriage.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince Bolesław & his wife had [three] children: 
2 CONT #[EUDOXIA [Audacia] [Margareta] (-after 1267).  
2 CONT #[daughter (before 1196-after 1249 or [1253]). 
2 CONT #[WIERZCHOSŁAWA (-2 Jan ---).  
2 CONT
2 CONT [293] Chronicon Polono-Silesiacum, MGH SS XIX, p. 562. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [294] Annales Cracovienses Compilati 1159, MGH SS XIX, p. 591. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [295] Annales Capituli Cracoviensis 1195, MGH SS XIX, p. 593. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [296] Chronicon Polono-Silesiacum, MGH SS XIX, p. 562. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
