2 CONT # B1. Mstislav "Udaloy", Pr of Toropetz (1181-13)+(1226-28), Pr of Novgorod (1210-15)+(1216-18), Pr of Galitzia (1215-16)+(1219-26), *ca 1170, +Torchesk 1228; m.N, a dau.of Khan Kotian of Kumans
