2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/110326636/person/120101114800 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 23 2017, 12:48:45 UTC''
