2 CONT Died: 18 Sep 1000 aged 50 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thyra married Björn "Styrbjorn" of Sweden Olafsson, son of Olaf of Sweden Bjornsson and Unknown. (Björn "Styrbjorn" of Sweden Olafsson was born about 959 and died in 986.) The cause of his death was he died in battle. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thyra next married Olav I Tryggvason, son of Tryggve Olavsson and Astrid Eiriksdatter, in 999. (Olav I Tryggvason was born circa 963 and died on 9 Sep 1000.)
