2 CONT Thyra ble gift med Styrbjørn af Sverige , Bolestav av Venden og Olav Trygvesøn. Thyra døde 18. sep.  år 1000.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Thyra Haraldsdatter (b. Aft. 956, d. 18 September 1000) Thyra Haraldsdatter (daughter of Harald 1. Blåtand and Gunhild Olavsdatter) was born Aft. 956, and died 18 September 1000. She married (1) Mieczyslaw, son of Ziemonslaw and G
2 CONC orka. She married (3) Burislaw.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thyra Haraldsdatter and Mieczyslaw are:  +Boleslaw 1., b. Abt. 967, d. 1025.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thyra Haraldsdatter are:  +Thorkill Sprakalæg, b. Abt. 936, d. Abt. 1005.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thyra Haraldsdatter and Burislaw are:  +Grimmus, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/s/k/o/Flemming-K-Skov/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0468.html
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Queen Thyra Haraldsdatter aka Haraldsdottir Born 0947 in Gormshoj, Jellinge, Vejle, Denmark Daughter of Harald G. Danmark and Gyrithe O. Munsö Sister of Gunhild Haraldsdottir, Gunhild Haroldsdotter, Walter Gifford, Harald de Crepo
2 CONC n, Gunhild Haraldsdatter, Mrs Ralph Detorta, Walter Gifford, Sigrid UNKNOWN, Gyrithe Olafsdotter Denmark, Gunhild Haraldsdottir of Denmark, Erik Hring Haraldsson Denmark, Gunhilde Haraldsdotter, Gunhild Denmark, Thyra Haraldsdatte
2 CONC r, Gunhild Haraldsdatter, Thyra Haraldsdottir UNKNOWN, Thyra Haroldsdotter, Svend H. King of Denmark, Norway and England, Haakon Gormsson, Sigrid Styrbjornsson, Thora Gormsson, Sigrid Sprakling, Sibell Crepon, Erik Haraldsson, Thr
2 CONC ya H. of Denmark and Odo Bayeux Wife of Styrbjorn Munsö — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Wife of Gorm of H. Danmark — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Mother of Torkel De Falaise Died September 18, 1000 in Orme
2 CONC n, Hin Lange, Norway
2 CONT
