2 CONT * Notes: '''ANNE Lauridsdatter Muus'''  Birth: Approximately 1420, '''Stenalt Gods''' Ørsted Sogn, Randers Amt  Marriage: '''ANDERS Jachimsen Bear'''  Death: Ca. 1492, Stenalt Gods Ørsted Sogn, Randers Amt at the age of about 72 y
2 CONC ears  Buried: Ca. 1492 Oersted Church, Randers Amt  Notes:  Owned Stenalt Goods Oersted Parish [1436-1460 (1490)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ANNE married ANDERS Jachimsen Bear, son of JACHIM Bjørnsen Bear and MARGRETE Andersdatter White. (ANDERS Jachimsen Bear was born about 1406, died about 1492 in Stenalt Gods Ørsted Sogn, Randers Amt and was buried in Ørsted Church,
2 CONC  Randers Amt.) 
2 CONT
