0 @N6000000005599087598@ NOTE Various sources disagree regarding Judith's specific ancestry.  Some s uggest that she was a daughter of Baldwin IV of Flanders, by his 2nd w ife, a princess of Normandy.  Others suggest that she was a daughter o f Baldwin V of Fl
1 CONC anders, and some say she was a daughter of Richard II I of Normandy.  Frederick Weis  in Ancestral Roots ( line 166, # 23 ) , suggests that she is the daughter of Baldwin IV, rather than of BALD WIN V, she married the Earl Tostig 
1 CONC of Northumbria before marrying Welf .
