0 @N6000000003232714194@ NOTE Described By Snorre As Calm, Handsome, Blond With Beard And Long Moustache, His Hands And Feet Were Large
1 CONT Facial Wound Disfigured Him For Life (Eyebrows)
1 CONT Half Brother Of Saint Olaf II Of Norge
1 CONT Hardrada Means Stern Council
1 CONT
1 CONT Half brother of Konungr Olaf Haraldsson  (Saint Olaf). Harald III Sigurdson
1 CONT Hardrade was wounded in the battle where Saint Olaf died.
1 CONT Some sources list his death on 23 September 1066.
1 CONT According to  BRIGITTE'S PAGES
1 CONT (http://worldroots.clicktron.com/brigitte/royal/bio/harald3 sigurdssonbio.h tml):  "Harald was only fifteen years old when fighting at the side of his half-brother at the battle of Stiklestad. He fled Norway and went to Gardariket
1 CONC  (Russia), then travelled on to Constantinople, known to the Vikings as Miklagard, where he served in the emperor's personal guard. In 1034 he returned to the Nordic countries as a wealthy man.  He gave some of his wealth to Konun
1 CONC gr Magnus and, as a reward, received part of Norway.  In 1047 when Magnus died, Harald became Konungr af both Norge and Denmark..."
