1 CONT Bretagne (ca. 982-1017).
1 CONT Baldvin V var hans sønn i ekteskapet med Otgiva. Hans datter, Judith av Flandern,
1 CONT skal være født i 1028 eller 1033, hvilket gjør at det er usikkert hvem som var hennes mor.
0 @N6000000001956371059@ NOTE
1 CONT Baldwin The Bearded, French Baudouin Le Barbu, Dutch Boudewijn De Schone Baardcount of Flanders (988–1035) who greatly expanded the Flemish dominions. He fought successfully both against the Capetian king of France, Robert II, and
1 CONC  the Holy Roman emperor Henry II. Henry found himself obliged to grant to Baldwin IV in fief Valenciennes, the burgraveship of Ghent, the land of Waes, and Zeeland. The count of Flanders thus became a feudatory of the empire as we
1 CONC ll as of the French crown. The French fiefs are known in Flemish history as Crown Flanders (Kroon-Vlaanderen), the German fiefs as Imperial Flanders (Rijks-Vlaanderen). Baldwin's son—afterwards Baldwin V—rebelled in 1028 against h
1 CONC is father at the instigation of his wife Adela, daughter of Robert II of France; but two years later peace was sworn at Oudenaarde, and the old countcontinued to reign until his death.
