0 @N6000000000944918558@ NOTE (Research):88,832 EYSTEIN JONSEN RINGNES, [born ca. 1360/5], living 1424, apparently dead by 1433 
1 CONT  =
1 CONT 88,833 HELGA GUNNULVSDATTER RINGNES, [born ca. 1360/5], living 1433, dau. of GUNNULV ERIKSEN RINGNES (# 177,666)
1 CONT
1 CONT  Children:
1 CONT
1 CONT  a) Gunnulv Eysteinsen, # 44,416 above
1 CONT
1 CONT  b) Halvard Eysteinsen, purchased land at Ringnes, 1414, 1424, 1433
1 CONT
1 CONT  c) n.n. Eysteinsdatter, married Hallvard Bjørnsen.  They evidently had three children.
1 CONT
1 CONT  d) Rønnaug Eysteinsdatter, married Asle Gjestsen, of Frogner parish, Lier.  She sold land at Ringnes to her brother, Halvard, in 1414
1 CONT
1 CONT [Aud Lian, Tolpinrud, p. 144; In 1414, Asle Gjestsen, wife Rønnaug Eysteinsdatter and son Eystein, of Frogner, Lier, sold 3 laups of land in east Ringnes to Halvard Eysteinsen; Bottolvsmessedag 1424, Eystein Jonsen and wife Helga 
1 CONC Gunnulvsdatter deeded 1 1/2 laups of land at nedregarden Ringnes to Halvard Eysteinsen; 1433 Helga Gunnulvsdatter sold part of Ringnes to son-in-law Hallvard Bjørnsen; 1433 Hallvard Bjørnsen sold 1/4 of 1/4 of west Ringnes toHalva
1 CONC rd Eysteinsen.]
