1 CONT
1 CONT He was the son of Henry the Black Duke of Bavaria, and Wulfhild,daughter of Magnus Billung, Duke of Saxony, and thus a member of theWelf family. His father and mother both died in 1126, and as his elderbrother Conrad had entered t
