0 @N6000000002475213017@ NOTE [paul.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT [Brøderbund WFT Vol. 4, Ed. 1, Tree #3757, Date of Import: May 30, 1999]
1 CONT
1 CONT Richard 11,surnamed the Good, Fourth Duke of Normandy, was the son of Richard the Fearless and a peasant woman named Gunnor. He married Judith, daughter of Count Godfrey of Brittany, and they were the parents of Richard 111,Robert
1 CONC  ,and Eleanor who married Baldwin.Baldwin was married the second time to Ogiva and they were the parents ofBaldwin V, Count of Flanders.[Capjr.FTW]
1 CONT
