0 @N6000000006296760059@ NOTE Frederick of Luxembourg (965 </wiki/965> - 6 October </wiki/October_6> 1019 </wiki/1019>), count of Moezelgouw </w/index.php?title=Moezelgouw&action=edit&redlink=1>, was a son of count Siegfried of Luxembourg </wiki/Siegfried_of_L
1 CONC uxembourg> and Hedwig of Nordgau </wiki/Hedwig_of_Nordgau>.
1 CONT By a wife whose name is unknown (certain historians give her as Ermentrude, countess of Gleiberg), he had :
1 CONT Henry II </wiki/Henry_VII,_Duke_of_Bavaria> († 1047), count of Luxembourg and duke of Bavaria
1 CONT Frederick </wiki/Frederick,_Duke_of_Lower_Lorraine> (1003 † 1065), Duke of Lower Lorraine </wiki/Duke_of_Lower_Lorraine>
1 CONT Giselbert </wiki/Giselbert_of_Luxembourg> (1007 † 1059), count of Longwy, of Salm and of Luxembourg
1 CONT Adalbéron III </w/index.php?title=Adalb%C3%A9ron_III_of_Metz&action=edit&redlink=1> († 1072), bishop of Metz </wiki/Bishop_of_Metz>
1 CONT Thierry, father of :
1 CONT Thierry († 1075)
1 CONT Henry († 1095), count palatine of Lorraine
1 CONT Poppon </w/index.php?title=Poppon_of_Metz&action=edit&redlink=1> († 1103), bishop of Metz
1 CONT Ogive (v. 990 † 1036), married in 1012 to Baldwin IV </wiki/Baldwin_IV,_Count_of_Flanders> (980 † 1035), count of Flanders </wiki/Count_of_Flanders>
1 CONT Ermengarde (1000 † 1057), married Welf II of Altdorf, count in Lechrain († 1030)
1 CONT Oda, canoness at Remiremont, then abbess of Saint-Rémy at Lunéville
1 CONT Gisèle (1019 † after 1058), married to Radulfe, lord of Aalst († after 1038)
1 CONT Retrieved from "<http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frederick_of_Luxembourg>"
