1 CONT
1 CONT [from Ancestry.com 139798.GED]
1 CONT Baldwin was one of the most influential rulers of 11th century Europe. He obtained the territory between the Scheldt and the Dender as an imperial fief from Emporer Henry IV of the Holy Roman Empire as well as the margravate of An
1 CONC twerp. He was regent of France after the death of Henry I and during the minority of Philip I. His oldest daughter married William the Conqueror and became Queen of England.
